URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/bluegrass-jam-3-2026-10-01/
SUMMARY:BLUEGRASS JAM
DESCRIPTION:\nDon't miss your chance to check out some of the best pickers 
 from all over WNC at our celebrated Bluegrass Jam curated by the multi-tal
 ented Drew Matulich — every Thursday starting at 7:00 pm!\n\n\n\nIt's al
 ways a show-stopping night of extraordinary musicianship —&nbsp\;and it'
 s only at Jack of the Wood Pub!&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nOpen jam follows at 9:30 pm.
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 4/10/JOTW_THU-BluegrassJam_2025_IG_1080x1350.jpg
END:VEVENT
