URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/holler-crow-3/
SUMMARY:HOLLER &amp\; CROW
DESCRIPTION:\nHoller &amp\; Crow specializes in whimsical folk fusion magic
 : music that makes listeners of all ages feel both transported and right a
 t home. Audiences are treated to familiar and cherished traditional folk s
 ongs\, humorous banter and delightful historical insights at every perform
 ance.\n\n\n\nWhether it’s an intimate duo performance\, a captivating tr
 io\, or a powerful 4-piece ensemble\, Holler &amp\; Crow consists of skill
 ed musicians and vocalists wielding powerful harmonies and folk instrument
 s including viola/big fiddle\, accordion\, banjo\, Irish bouzouki\, guitar
 \, and adding a touch of rhythmic flair with hand percussion.\n\n\n\nBring
  your dancing hobbit feet over and have a pint with us! Music 8:30-11:30pm
  $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D
 8yw--JZlaE\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/09/Hollerandcrow5.png
END:VEVENT
