SUMMARY:STRANGER COMPANY
DESCRIPTION:\nStranger Company&nbsp\;is an Atlanta-based alternative rock b
 and that blends funk\, jazz\, and southern rock into an electrifying sound
 . Comprised of Davis Wynn\, Nick Pedersen\, and Josh Newton\, these season
 ed musicians know how to ignite a crowd with their captivating energy.With
  a setlist that combines their own original music with dynamic covers - fr
 om the Talking Heads to Alice in Chains - Stranger Company offers an unfor
 gettable musical experience that keeps fans moving all night long. Whether
  performing at major festivals like the 2024 Lovin’ Life Music Festival 
 or rocking the dive bars of Atlanta\, they know how to turn any venue into
  a high-energy celebration.\n\n\n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm\, $10 cover at the d
 oor.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/w6bXneeNllU?feature=shared\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps
 ://youtu.be/j_PHsi17P8U?feature=shared\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 4/05/StrangerCompany_BW.jpg
