SUMMARY:Lenny Pettinelli &amp\; Friends
DESCRIPTION:\nLocal legend Lenny Pettinelli wears a lot of different hats\,
  and all of them are funky. With stylish grooves and backbeat that just wo
 n't stop\, Lenny plays keys and synth for ears both discerning and novice.
  Long-time member of acclaimed local supergroup The Empire Strikes Brass\,
  Lenny and his ragtag group of musicians always bring the heat. Bring your
  dancing shoes.\n\n\n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm\, $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7RtXwRfTESA\n\n\n\n\n\nh
 ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TnQUdpd68NQ\n\n
